+====================================================================
+§XVII. Conformance Tests #conformance
+====================================================================
+
+An implementation MUST pass all tests in the conformance suite.
+Tests are defined as executable `ConformanceTest` objects in `reasoning_kernel.py`:
+
+```python
+from reasoning_kernel import build_conformance_suite, ConformanceTest
+
+# Build the full 20-test suite
+suite = build_conformance_suite()
+
+# Run all tests
+all_pass = True
+for test in suite:
+    result = test.execute()
+    status = "PASS" if result else "FAIL"
+    print(f"  [{status}] {test.name}: {test.description}")
+    if not result:
+        all_pass = False
+
+assert all_pass, "Conformance suite must pass"
+
+# Individual test access
+test = next(t for t in suite if t.name == "digest_determinism")
+assert test.execute() is True, "Contract digest must be deterministic"
+```
+
+**Conformance test names** (20 required):
+
+| # | `test.name` | Description |
+|---|-------------|-------------|
+| 1 | `digest_determinism` | `compute_contract_digest()` is deterministic |
+| 2 | `modify_no_write_rejected` | Invariants reject MODIFY with NO_WRITE |
+| 3 | `stale_approval_detected` | Stale approval detected after material change |
+| 4 | `path_escape_rejected` | Path escape / parent traversal rejected |
+| 5 | `symlink_swap_detected` | Symlink swap between approval/execution |
+| 6 | `hardlink_disclosure` | Hard-link via `ResourceIdentity.link_count` |
+| 7 | `exclusive_creation` | Exclusive creation under verified parent |
+| 8 | `wildcard_frozen` | Wildcard expansion frozen at approval time |
+| 9 | `undeclared_write_rejected` | Undeclared write rejected by sandbox |
+| 10 | `process_termination` | Process-tree termination on timeout |
+| 11 | `audit_effects_budgeted` | Audit/backup effects counted in budgets |
+| 12 | `budget_exceedance_stops` | Budget exceedance stops execution |
+| 13 | `atomic_partial_failure` | Atomic-group failure → PARTIAL state |
+| 14 | `rollback_concurrency_guard` | Rollback guard blocks concurrent writes |
+| 15 | `exact_byte_restoration` | Exact restore without payload annotation |
+| 16 | `missing_artifact_blocks` | Missing artifact prevents mutation |
+| 17 | `negative_claim_scoped` | Negative-claim scoped to monitored domains |
+| 18 | `idempotency_prevents_double` | Idempotency key prevents double-mutation |
+| 19 | `sensitive_data_egress_blocked` | Sensitive-data egress blocked |
+| 20 | `reverse_order_rollback` | Reverse-order multi-resource rollback |
